{"id":"e56b42300668cf3b","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-link-complement.md","title":"Link Complement","display":"df-link-complement — Link Complement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-link-complement","aliases":["58-df-link-complement","Link Complement"],"display":"df-link-complement — Link Complement","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-link.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-link-complement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-link-complement</span><span>Link Complement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-link-complement — Link Complement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"257329a60eacb063\" href=\"?note=257329a60eacb063\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-link.md\">../batch10/58-df-link.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,\\ell,m,X_L\\in V\">\\(L,\\ell,m,X_L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Link}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Link}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (link predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"257329a60eacb063\" href=\"?note=257329a60eacb063\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-link.md\">../batch10/58-df-link.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinkComplement}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{LinkComplement}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (link-complement predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}link\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinkComplement}_S(X_L,L,\\ell,m)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\\land X_L=S^3\\setminus L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}link\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinkComplement}_S(X_L,L,\\ell,m)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\\land X_L=S^3\\setminus L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom defines the topological complement of the embedded link set.</li>\n<li>The compact link exterior <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^3\\setminus\\operatorname{int}(N(L))\">\\(S^3\\setminus\\operatorname{int}(N(L))\\)</span> requires separately supplied tubular-neighborhood and interior data; it is homeomorphic to this complement but is not literally the same subset.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rolfsen, Knots and Links</li>\n<li>Thurston, Three-Dimensional Geometry and Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-link.md","status":"resolved","id":"257329a60eacb063","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-link.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-link.md","status":"resolved","id":"257329a60eacb063","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Link}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (link predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-link.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,\\ell,m,X_L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Link}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinkComplement}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}link\\text{-}complement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LinkComplement}_S(X_L,L,\\ell,m)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Link}_S(L,\\ell,m)\\land X_L=S^3\\setminus L.","display":true},{"tex":"S^3\\setminus\\operatorname{int}(N(L))","display":false}],"bytes":1086,"backlinks":[{"id":"0c88d7bf21633cb8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-789","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-link-complement.md|58-df-link-complement]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["257329a60eacb063"]}